# Direct runtime dependencies of Statistical Research Assistant: the ranges
# the code supports. Never install from this file. Install from the lock,
# requirements.txt, which pins every package (direct and transitive) to one
# version with SHA-256 hashes. `flet build windows` bundles exactly that lock.
#
# Regenerate the lock after editing this file (docs/STAGE368_BUILD_LOCK.md):
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --universal --python-version 3.12 \
#     --generate-hashes --exclude-newer <UTC timestamp> -o requirements.txt
#
# Flet is pinned exactly: the Python package, the flet-cli that builds the
# Windows program (requirements-dev.in) and the Flutter client it embeds
# must all be the same release.
